# Course participants, one per line. Copy this file to participants.yaml.
#
# Names are turned into Snowflake identifiers by upper-casing them and replacing
# anything that is not a letter or digit with an underscore, so "grace.hopper"
# becomes the user ACADEMY_DBT_GRACE_HOPPER and the schema GRACE_HOPPER.
#
# Removing a name and re-applying drops that participant's user, role and schema,
# along with everything in it.
- grace.hopper
- ada.lovelace
- alan.turing
